00:26:34,521 --> 00:26:36,920
The fire genie escapes the bottle

322
00:26:36,921 --> 00:26:39,440
Which means that every 20 seconds

323
00:26:39,441 --> 00:26:43,480
a fire department is dispatched somewhere in the 50 states.

324
00:26:46,580 --> 00:26:49,720
Annually, these fires kill around 4,000 Americans

325
00:26:49,721 --> 00:26:52,600
and injure about 300,000 others.

326
00:26:54,620 --> 00:26:58,120
Our fear of fire can be seen even when the flames go out.

327
00:26:59,320 --> 00:27:03,080
The office you work in, shopping mall, home,

328
00:27:03,520 --> 00:27:07,240
you would find that fire has shaped almost every part of that.

329
00:27:07,241 --> 00:27:09,740
It's the fear of fire that has shaped it.

