00:27:15,841 --> 00:27:20,840
It will determine how many people can inhabit a particular room.

333
00:27:20,841 --> 00:27:25,140
All these considerations are built into that, but there will not be,

334
00:27:25,141 --> 00:27:27,540
if all goes according to plan, fire itself.

