00:28:55,799 --> 00:29:04,900
In the course of their rampage they set fire to over 9,000 vehicles and torch

354
00:29:04,901 --> 00:29:14,420
over a hundred buildings, including businesses, public offices, schools and even churches.

355
00:29:14,421 --> 00:29:19,620
Much of the damage is done with improvised incendiary devices, otherwise known as Molotov

356
00:29:19,621 --> 00:29:25,303
cocktails. Well, a Molotov cocktail is a homemade incendiary weapon.

357
00:29:25,304 --> 00:29:27,560
It can be as simple as just

358
00:29:27,561 --> 00:29:34,742
putting gasoline in a bottle, putting a wick in it, and throwing it in a hurry.

