00:29:34,743 --> 00:29:36,560
The poor man's bomb,

360
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:42,140
this cheap way of torching a target, has been a weapon of choice for insurgents since the Second

361
00:29:42,141 --> 00:29:47,500
World War. It was named after Soviet foreign minister

