00:30:57,821 --> 00:30:59,820
as a primary method of combat on the battlefield,

377
00:30:59,821 --> 00:31:05,680
fire remained very dominant as a psychological and very devastating tool against the opponent.

378
00:31:06,420 --> 00:31:10,720
But sometime after the 12th century AD, the recipe for Greek fire was lost,

379
00:31:11,100 --> 00:31:12,720
