00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:41,760
You see the tank group is on the back of the Marine.

401
00:32:41,761 --> 00:32:45,500
The gun group is then held in these hands with the right hand controlling product,

402
00:32:45,600 --> 00:32:46,900
the left hand holding the igniter.

403
00:32:48,220 --> 00:32:52,580
The Mark II-2 flamethrowers were used extensively in the Pacific theater

404
00:32:52,581 --> 00:32:53,820
